title: Start
tags: chapter1
---
// The traveller arrives at the toll house after dark.
Keeper: You are late on the road, and the gate is shut until light.
Keeper: I can offer a bench and a fire, and nothing better.
-> Ask why the gate shuts at all
    <<set $asked_gate to true>>
    Keeper: Because the ford runs high, and the ford has taken people.
    <<jump Bench>>
-> Ask about the fire
    Keeper: It is a fire. It has no history worth the telling.
    <<jump Bench>>
-> Say nothing and sit
    <<set $stayed_quiet to true>>
    <<jump Bench>>
===

title: Bench
---
Keeper: There is bread, if you want it. It is yesterday's.
<<if $asked_gate>>
Keeper: You asked about the ford. Most people ask about the fire.
<<endif>>
-> Take the bread
    <<set $took_bread to true>>
    Keeper: Good. It goes stale either way.
    <<jump End>>
-> Refuse it
    Keeper: Suit yourself.
    <<jump End>>
===

title: End
---
<<if $took_bread>>
The bread is gone before the fire is.
<<else>>
The bread sits where he left it.
<<endif>>
The fire settles. Outside, the ford keeps going in the dark.
===
